   "read": true,
   "quote": "Wheat/barley/oats 450-650 mm; maize 500-800; rice (paddy) 450-700; soybean 450-700; cotton 700-1300; sugarcane 1500-2500; peanut 500-700; bean 300-500 (mm per growing period). The midpoint is used here. Rice figures do not include seepage losses."
  },
